// Per-expert mixed-K decode A/B kernels: each block dispatches its GEMV tile on the expert rate
// k2 = 2*bits + half from the per-projection table. Instantiated rates (mul1): 2, 2.5, 3, 3.5, 4, 5, 6, 8.

